<p>Formula One and the FIA have cancelled the Bahrain and Saudi Arabian Grands Prix scheduled for April because of the war in the Middle East and related safety concerns across the region. The Bahrain race had been set for April 12, followed by the Saudi race on April 19.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/CHDXjKU0InZq3DVasnDjAppKoJVfJZso-CR7Xmaqpa5o3aR5EULGnHvuWNo_rGArwMZ1bsIauvuWzuAtMsArBdXda_9i1AM8B8EVTnf4BSnX9taV8ZNIugFap1N79B5iJ7zF1J1vM3lnKsV1pUIw9V0-fuAYI80tl88KBjPRHdd2x93ayPuAN69BsnqktoxtAa2tUPeOozbglb7Kcy9lAu60GFDmLR-F-aDEWTjrn-e_IHZYbvdMDUuWCCPaA9wVgmIy_Lbv-2jp4-Xv0A' alt='Aston Martin&#x27;s Lance Stroll during practice at the Jeddah Corniche Circuit in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia, in April of 2025.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Base proximity: The Bahrain International Circuit is about 20 miles from a US base that has been targeted during the conflict, which helps explain why organizers judged the security risk too high.</li></ul><blockquote>It has been confirmed today that, after careful evaluations, due to the ongoing situation in the Middle East region, the Bahrain and Saudi Arabian Grands Prix will not take place in April - FIA</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Formula One organizers: Organizers considered other options for the April calendar but ultimately chose not to replace either cancelled event. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/f1-races-bahrain-saudi-cancelled-due-iran-war'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>People familiar with planning: Sources said the cancelled rounds are unlikely to return later in the season because rescheduling them would be difficult both operationally and climatically. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-formula-one-grands-prix-races-bahrain-saudi-arabia-middle-east-iran/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-formula-one-grands-prix-races-bahrain-saudi-arabia-middle-east-iran/'>Formula One cancels April races in Bahrain and Saudi Arabia because of Middle East conflict</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/f1-races-bahrain-saudi-cancelled-due-iran-war'>F1 races in Bahrain, Saudi cancelled due to Iran war</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2026/3/14/bahrain-and-saudi-f1-races-cancelations-confirmed-due-to-iran-war'>Bahrain and Saudi Arabia F1 race cancellations confirmed due to Iran war</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/mar/14/formula-one-cancel-bahrain-saudi-arabia-grand-prix-war-middle-east'>F1 cancels Bahrain and Saudi Arabia GPs because of Middle East war</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20260314-f1-races-in-bahrain-saudi-cancelled-due-to-iran-war'>In auto racing, the Fédération Internationale de l&#x27;Automobile cancels the upcoming Bahrain and Saudi Arabian Grands Prix due to safety concerns amid the Iran war. Both events were scheduled to take place in mid-April.</a> - france24.com</li></ul>